From b4c84056bc3f44a8b7e5b07f0e3b91dee5fe05b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dan <dan@awto.au>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 10:52:04 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] ARM: dts: broadcom: Add Ubiquiti UniFi US-48-500W

Add the Ubiquiti UniFi Switch 48 PoE 500W: BCM53344 Hurricane 2 with
128+128 MiB RAM, 32 MiB SPI NOR, a BCM53346 switch behind PCIe, the
CMIC SMBus with a PCA9548 mux and four LM75 temperature sensors, and
a syscon-reboot using the DMU reset bit that the stock firmware uses.

The console is the second UART, as on other Hurricane 2 boards. No
bootargs are given, they are provided by the bootloader or the kernel
configuration.

Signed-off-by: TODO
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/Makefile           |   3 +-
 .../bcm53344-ubnt-unifi-us-48-500w.dts        | 159 ++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 161 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm53344-ubnt-unifi-us-48-500w.dts

diff --git a/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/Makefile b/arch/arm/boot/dts/broadcom/Makefile
